WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.945
By the end of the module you should be able to
normalize common text problems

00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:09.892
choose the right temporal type change time grain
calculate durations and separate parsing from
formatting

00:00:11.651 --> 00:00:17.295
You should also be able to explain why a
transformation is appropriate The

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:22.232
objective is not to memorize a long list of
functions It is to select the

00:00:22.259 --> 00:00:26.087
right function based on the meaning of the value and
the analytical task
